("v3105", "type", "String")
("v3105", "scalar", "The automatic checks cover document language markers, a skip link with its target and image alt-attribute presence. Alternative-text meaning, focus order, keyboard operation, assistive technology, reflow and visual contrast remain evaluation work. WCAG conformance requires a separate scoped evaluation.")
