("v9420", "type", "String")
("v9420", "scalar", "Declared inventory plus automatic generated-output discovery across the entire root homepage and all four identity homepages. Undeclared text and attributes become undecided groups with located evidence; exact declarations do not cover descendants. Nested catalogue output is scanned. External dependencies and inline code bodies stay opaque. This is not exhaustive corpus, DOM, transitive dependency, runtime-state, visual or semantic verification. Existing Threads, Map, reading and eight-decision evidence retain their stated scopes.")
