("v23938", "type", "Entry")
("v23938", "key", "boundary")
("v23939", "type", "String")
("v23939", "scalar", "This general roadmap combines declared product plans with assurance-derived work. Assurance is one source of work, not the scope of the roadmap. Priorities are review and planning order, not release promises or certified defect severity. Repeated observations are grouped without asserting a shared cause. Ownership and receipts are authored records; their presence does not authenticate an external reviewer. Disappearance alone never completes work.")
